  "reverted": "BOSS2 back to doc (60.000, 145.000); both keep-out rule areas back to their registered rectangles; the /SX1262_RXEN barrel back to (38.200, 135.000).  The board now differs from D-757 by exactly one line.",
  "what": "D-758 read FBV2_P1_KEEPOUTS.md section 1 as current.  That file's own header says every section-1 X coordinate gains +1.000 mm (FBV2-EXP-002, 70.000 -> 72.000 mm grown symmetrically).  D-758 therefore moved both boss keep-outs and BOSS2 onto the PRE-REBASE datum, correcting a real defect into a different one: at x = 59.000 BOSS2's keep-out runs 0.750 mm into IR_TX_OPTICAL."
 },
